# Duskwood - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and manuals whose SOURCE is physically in
# Duskwood, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item vendor and drop tables). Nine recipes are vendor-sold by in-zone
# Alliance and neutral vendors; five more drop each from a single named
# in-zone mob (noted honestly where the same recipe also drops in a few
# other zones). Every other Duskwood-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone
# world drop, and quest records carry no reward data, so neither ships (see
# docs/duskwood-companions-inventory.md and docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides
# cover those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip
# it cleanly. Leatherworking, Cooking, Fishing and Enchanting have no
# Duskwood source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/duskwood-recipes
title Duskwood - Recipes & Patterns
levels 17-28
zone Duskwood
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords duskwood, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Darkshire tailors — Sheri's stock (Tailoring)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Sheri Zipstitch (75.68, 45.57) sells patterns in Darkshire.
  buy 6275 "Pattern: Greater Adept's Robe"
  buy 6401 "Pattern: Dark Silk Shirt"
  note The Dark Silk Shirt is also sold by Horde vendors elsewhere; the Alliance source is Sheri.

step Darkshire tailors — Danielle's stock (Tailoring)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Danielle Zipstitch (75.87, 45.56) sells patterns in Darkshire.
  buy 14627 "Pattern: Bright Yellow Shirt"
  note Duskwood is the only zone in the data where this pattern is sold.

step Darkshire tailors — reagent bags (Tailoring)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Lohgan Eva (75.71, 44.56), Danielle Zipstitch (75.87, 45.56) and Sheri Zipstitch (75.68, 45.57) all sell these in Darkshire.
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag"
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag"

step Kzixx's stock — north-east (Alchemy, Engineering)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Alchemy 1

  tip Kzixx (81.82, 19.77), neutral, sells recipes in the north-east.
  buy 6053 "Recipe: Holy Protection Potion"
  buy 210709 "Recipe: Elixir of Coalesced Regret"

step Kzixx's stock — north-east (Engineering)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Kzixx (81.82, 19.77), neutral, sells schematics in the north-east.
  buy 7561 "Schematic: Goblin Jumper Cables"

step Bliztik's stock — the west (Alchemy)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Alchemy 1

  tip Bliztik (18.04, 54.36), neutral, sells recipes in the west.
  buy 6068 "Recipe: Shadow Oil"

step Raven Hill crypt — sterling silver (Blacksmithing)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop
  goto 76.88,70.25
  goto 76.91,72.20
  kill 48 optional
  collect 251336 "Plans: Sterling Silver Leggings" optional
  note The Skeletal Warrior (level 21) at Raven Hill is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step West coast — clever poultice (First Aid)

  zone map 1431

  when skill First Aid 1

  loop
  goto 21.27,71.96
  goto 21.35,73.36
  kill 910 optional
  collect 255724 "Manual: Clever Poultice" optional
  note The Defias Enchanter (level 26) on the west coast is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step West coast — robes of arcana (Tailoring)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Tailoring 1

  loop
  goto 21.27,71.96
  goto 21.35,73.36
  kill 910 optional
  collect 5773 "Pattern: Robes of Arcana" optional
  note The Defias Enchanter (level 26) on the west coast is the named in-zone dropper; the same pattern also drops in a few other zones, so this is a genuine Duskwood source, not the only one. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step North — invoker's cord (Tailoring)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Tailoring 1

  loop
  goto 15.04,42.00
  goto 15.28,46.38
  kill 531 optional
  collect 215369 "Pattern: Invoker's Cord" optional
  note The Skeletal Fiend (level 24) in the north is the named in-zone dropper; the same pattern also drops in a few other zones, so this is a genuine Duskwood source, not the only one. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step North-east shore — cleric's elixir (Alchemy)

  zone map 1431

  when skill Alchemy 1

  loop
  goto 58.60,9.80
  goto 62.20,11.10
  kill 46 optional
  collect 250366 "Recipe: Minor Cleric's Elixir" optional
  note The Murloc Forager (level 9) on the north-east shore is the named in-zone dropper; the same recipe also drops in Elwynn Forest and Redridge, so this is a genuine Duskwood source, not the only one. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step No Duskwood source — other professions

  zone map 1431

  note Leatherworking, Cooking, Fishing and Enchanting have no recipe source physically in Duskwood in the data — no vendor sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them — so this guide carries nothing for them. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.
